# N5 (per-step context selector) is complete and its parity merge is resolved.

## Status
- N5 deliverables are in the working tree and pass their acceptance suites:
  - `src/agent/contextSelector.ts` (the per-step selector)
  - `src/agent/__tests__/contextSelector.test.ts`
  - `src/agent/__tests__/contextSelectorLongHorizon.test.ts`
  They are untracked here only because this worktree's earlier session never committed them
  (its `wip: auto-commit before gate` commit captured the merge-conflicted merge parents
  instead). They will land with the next N5 commit.
- The gate failure that started this session was a **merge conflict**, not a code defect:
  `MERGE CONFLICT with latest manus-parity in: src/graph/runGraph.ts`.

## Merge resolutions
- `src/graph/runGraph.ts` at `c42bfc9`: both sides had added a `case` to `RunGraph.apply`'s
  live-only run. Ours added `case "context_selected":` (N5); parity added
  `case "workspace_command":` and `case "workspace_open_request":`. Kept both.
- `src/agent/events.ts` at `fff7a7f`: ours added the `context_selected` event member;
  parity added `video_studio_export`. Kept both.
- Final parity tip `ca08d4c` merged clean at `7b96c28`;
  `git merge-base --is-ancestor manus-parity HEAD` exits 0.

## Gates on the final tree
- `npx tsc --noEmit` -> exit 0
- `npm run build:server` -> exit 0
- `(cd packages/web && npx next build)` -> exit 0 (25/25 static pages)
- N5 selector + runGraph + loop -> 53 tests, 53 pass, 0 fail
- selector + graph + loop combined -> 57 tests, 57 pass, 0 fail
- N19 suites brought in by the final merge -> 37 tests, 37 pass, 0 fail

No test was weakened, deleted or skipped. No source file was edited except to remove
conflict-marker lines. Full details are in the `.jdone` rollup under the heading
"N5 merge gate: resolved the manus-parity conflict in src/graph/runGraph.ts".
